classDiagram
    direction LR
    class BookingBuilder {
        -Customer _customer
        -Screening _screening
        -List~string~ _seatLabels
        -string _note
        +ForCustomer(Customer) BookingBuilder
        +ForScreening(Screening) BookingBuilder
        +AddSeat(string label) BookingBuilder
        +AddSeats(string[] labels) BookingBuilder
        +WithNote(string note) BookingBuilder
        +Build() Booking
        +Reset() BookingBuilder
    }
    class Booking {
        +Customer Customer
        +Screening Screening
        +IReadOnlyList~Seat~ Seats
        +string Note
        +decimal TotalPrice
    }
    class Program {
        +Main() void
    }
    class BookingService {
        +Confirm(Booking) Booking
    }
    Program ..> BookingBuilder : configures step by step
    BookingBuilder ..> Booking : Build() validates and creates
    Program ..> BookingService : passes the finished Booking
    BookingService ..> Booking : prices, charges, saves
    note for BookingBuilder "Each step returns the builder itself (fluent interface)"
